lates through a delay one period of the key long. On each pass a two-point average darkens it, and a gain lets it fall about 60 dB over Ring. Twang shortens that average for a brighter, buzzier string. Bend sets how far below the key the string sounds when plucked; while the key is held the player presses it up to the key over Time. Let go and it falls back to the open string as it is damped within about 200 ms. A harder strike plays louder.\",\"lineage\":\"i_koto\",\"factory\":\"koto\",\"retired\":[],\"voices\":6,\"controls\":[{\"slot\":1,\"id\":\"bend\",\"label\":\"Bend\",\"min\":0,\"max\":3,\"unit\":\"st\",\"default\":1,\"rand\":[0,2],\"hint\":\"How far below the key the string starts; holding the key presses it up to pitch\"},{\"slot\":2,\"id\":\"bend_time\",\"label\":\"Time\",\"min\":30,\"max\":1500,\"curve\":\"exp\",\"unit\":\"ms\",\"default\":300,\"rand\":[100,800],\"hint\":\"Time the bend takes to rise 95% of the way to its full height\"},{\"slot\":3,\"id\":\"ring\",\"label\":\"Ring\",\"min\":300,\"max\":6000,\"curve\":\"exp\",\"unit\":\"ms\",\"default\":2200,\"rand\":[800,4000],\"hint\":\"Time for a held string to fall about 60 dB\"},{\"slot\":4,\"id\":\"twang\",\"label\":\"Twang\",\"min\":0,\"max\":100,\"unit\":\"%\",\"default\":60,\"rand\":[20,90],\"hint\":\"How bright and buzzy the string is: higher shortens the two-point average that darkens each pass\"}],\"nodes\":[{\"id\":\"bend\",\"op\":\"param\",\"control\":\"bend\"},{\"id\":\"bend_time\",\"op\":\"param\",\"control\":\"bend_time\"},{\"id\":\"ring\",\"op\":\"param\",\"control\":\"ring\"},{\"id\":\"twang\",\"op\":\"param\",\"control\":\"twang\"},{\"id\":\"hz\",\"op\":\"note\",\"base\":48},{\"id\":\"hit\",\"op\":\"trig\"},{\"id\":\"held\",\"op\":\"gate\"},{\"id\":\"rate\",\"op\":\"sr\"},{\"id\":\"press\",\"op\":\"mul\"},{\"id\":\"pressed\",\"op\":\"history\"},{\"id\":\"bend_tau\",\"op\":\"div\",\"b\":3},{\"id\":\"lean\",\"op\":\"slide\",\"down\":30},{\"id\":\"from_key\",\"op\":\"sub\"},{\"id\":\"octave